<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - 3COM cut by SoundView.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - 3COM cut by SoundView.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- SoundView Financial Group analyst Michael Karfopoulos said he cut his long-term rating on computer networking company 3Com Corp to hold from buy, keeping a short-term hold on the stock.</p>
<p>-- said he had difficulty seeing 3Com moving into high-growth wide area networking.</p>
</text>
